{"id":"ch16","number":"15","title":"可變長度子網路遮罩 VLSM","en":"Subnetting / VLSM · Part 3","start":72,"end":75,"domain":"fundamentals","topics":["ipv4"],"scope":"core","order":16,"pages":[{"page":72,"image":"/data/pdf/pages/0072.jpg","blocks":[{"en":"15. SUBNETTING (VLSM) : PART 3","source":"text","id":"p72-b1","segments":[{"en":"15.","zh":"15.","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"SUBNETTING (VLSM) : PART 3","zh":"子網路切割(VLSM):部分3","method":"local-mt","version":2}],"zh":"15.\n子網路切割(VLSM):部分3","kind":"prose"},{"en":"The process of subnetting Class A, Class B, and Class C is identical. \nSUBNETTING CLASS A NETWORKS \nGiven a 10.0.0.0/8 network, you must create 2000 subnets which will distributed to various enterprises. \nWhat prefix length must you use? \n2^10 = 1024 so 2^11 = 2048. We have to \"borrow\" 11 bits (Left to Right) to get enough subnets \n0000 1010 . 0000 0000 . 000 | 00000 . 0000 0000 \n8 bits + 8 bits + 3 = 19 bits \n0000 1010 . 0000 0000 . 000 | 00000 . 0000 0000 1111 1111 . 1111 1111 . 111 | 00000 . 0000 0000 \n255.255.224.0 is the Subnet mask \nThe answer is /19 (/8 + /11 = /19) \nHow many hosts per subnet? There are 13 host bits remaining so: \n2^13 - 2 = 8190 hosts per subnet \n \nVARIABLE-LENGTH SUBNET MASKS (VLSM)","source":"text","id":"p72-b2","segments":[{"en":"The process of subnetting Class A, Class B, and Class C is identical.","zh":"子網路切割A級,B級,C級的流程相同.","method":"local-mt"},{"en":"SUBNETTING CLASS A NETWORKS","zh":"子網路切割A級網路","method":"local-mt","version":2},{"en":"Given a 10.0.0.0/8 network, you must create 2000 subnets which will distributed to various enterprises.","zh":"鑑於10.0.0.0/8網路,你必須建立2000子網路,分配給各種企業。","method":"local-mt"},{"en":"What prefix length must you use?","zh":"您必須使用什麼字首長度 ?","method":"local-mt"},{"en":"2^10 = 1024 so 2^11 = 2048.","zh":"2^10 = 1024 so 2^11 = 2048.","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"We have to \"borrow\" 11 bits (Left to Right) to get enough subnets","zh":"我們必須\"借\"11位(從左到右)才能得到足夠的子網路.","method":"local-mt"},{"en":"0000 1010 . 0000 0000 . 000 | 00000 . 0000 0000","zh":"0000 1010 . 0000 0000 . 000 | 00000 . 0000 0000","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"8 bits + 8 bits + 3 = 19 bits","zh":"8位數 +8位數 +3 = 19位數","method":"local-mt-protected-fragments"},{"en":"0000 1010 . 0000 0000 . 000 | 00000 . 0000 0000 1111 1111 . 1111 1111 . 111 | 00000 . 0000 0000","zh":"0000 1010 . 0000 0000 . 000 | 00000 . 0000 0000 1111 1111 . 1111 1111 . 111 | 00000 . 0000 0000","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"255.255.224.0 is the Subnet mask","zh":"255.255.224.0是子網路遮罩","method":"local-mt"},{"en":"The answer is /19 (/8 + /11 = /19)","zh":"答案是/19(/8+/11=/19).","method":"local-mt"},{"en":"How many hosts per subnet?","zh":"每子網路個多少個主機?","method":"local-mt"},{"en":"There are 13 host bits remaining so:","zh":"仍有13主機位子如此:","method":"local-mt"},{"en":"2^13 - 2 = 8190 hosts per subnet","zh":"2^13 - 2 = 8190 主機百分比子網路","method":"local-mt-protected-fragments"},{"en":"VARIABLE-LENGTH SUBNET MASKS (VLSM)","zh":"可變長子網路口罩(VLSM)","method":"local-mt","version":2}],"zh":"子網路切割A級,B級,C級的流程相同.\n子網路切割A級網路\n鑑於10.0.0.0/8網路,你必須建立2000子網路,分配給各種企業。\n您必須使用什麼字首長度 ?\n2^10 = 1024 so 2^11 = 2048.\n我們必須\"借\"11位(從左到右)才能得到足夠的子網路.\n0000 1010 . 0000 0000 . 000 | 00000 . 0000 0000\n8位數 +8位數 +3 = 19位數\n0000 1010 . 0000 0000 . 000 | 00000 . 0000 0000 1111 1111 . 1111 1111 . 111 | 00000 . 0000 0000\n255.255.224.0是子網路遮罩\n答案是/19(/8+/11=/19).\n每子網路個多少個主機?\n仍有13主機位子如此:\n2^13 - 2 = 8190 主機百分比子網路\n可變長子網路口罩(VLSM)","kind":"prose"},{"en":"• \nUntil now, we have practiced subnetting using FLSM (Fixed-Length Subnet Masks). \n• \nThis means that all of the subnets use the same prefix length (ie: Subnetting a Class C network \ninto 4 subnets using /26) \n• \nVLSM (Variable-Length Subnet Masks) is the process of creating subnets of different sizes, to \nmake your use of network addresses more efficient. \n• \nVLSM is more complicated than FLSM, BUT it's easy if you follow the steps correctly.","source":"text","id":"p72-b3","segments":[{"en":"•","zh":"•","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"Until now, we have practiced subnetting using FLSM (Fixed-Length Subnet Masks).","zh":"直到現在,我們一直使用flasm(Fixed-Length 子網路 Masks)練習子網路切割.","method":"local-mt","version":2},{"en":"•","zh":"•","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"This means that all of the subnets use the same prefix length (ie: Subnetting a Class C network into 4 subnets using /26)","zh":"這意味著所有子網路使用相同的字首長度(即:子網路切割一個C級網路使用/26進入4子網路).","method":"local-mt"},{"en":"•","zh":"•","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"VLSM (Variable-Length Subnet Masks) is the process of creating subnets of different sizes, to make your use of network addresses more efficient.","zh":"VLSM (Variable-Length 子網路 Masks) 是建立大小不同的子網路的過程,以使您對網路地址的使用更有效率.","method":"local-mt"},{"en":"•","zh":"•","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"VLSM is more complicated than FLSM, BUT it's easy if you follow the steps correctly.","zh":"VLSM比\"花\"更復雜,但是如果你正確遵循步驟,那很容易.","method":"local-mt","version":2}],"zh":"•\n直到現在,我們一直使用flasm(Fixed-Length 子網路 Masks)練習子網路切割.\n•\n這意味著所有子網路使用相同的字首長度(即:子網路切割一個C級網路使用/26進入4子網路).\n•\nVLSM (Variable-Length 子網路 Masks) 是建立大小不同的子網路的過程,以使您對網路地址的使用更有效率.\n•\nVLSM比\"花\"更復雜,但是如果你正確遵循步驟,那很容易.","kind":"prose"},{"en":"VLSM","source":"image-ocr","id":"p72-b4","segments":[{"en":"VLSM","zh":"VLSM","method":"local-mt-protected-fragments"}],"zh":"VLSM","kind":"prose"},{"en":"Tokyo LAN A","source":"image-ocr","id":"p72-b5","segments":[{"en":"Tokyo LAN A","zh":"東京LAN A","method":"local-mt"}],"zh":"東京LAN A","kind":"prose"},{"en":"Toronto LAN A","source":"image-ocr","id":"p72-b6","segments":[{"en":"Toronto LAN A","zh":"多倫多LAN A","method":"local-mt"}],"zh":"多倫多LAN A","kind":"prose"},{"en":"Point-to-point connection","source":"image-ocr","id":"p72-b7","segments":[{"en":"Point-to-point connection","zh":"點對點連線","method":"local-mt"}],"zh":"點對點連線","kind":"prose"},{"en":"110 hosts","source":"image-ocr","id":"p72-b8","segments":[{"en":"110 hosts","zh":"110 主機","method":"local-mt"}],"zh":"110 主機","kind":"prose"},{"en":"29 hosts","source":"image-ocr","id":"p72-b9","segments":[{"en":"29 hosts","zh":"29 主機","method":"local-mt"}],"zh":"29 主機","kind":"prose"},{"en":"Tokyo LAN B","source":"image-ocr","id":"p72-b10","segments":[{"en":"Tokyo LAN B","zh":"東京LANB","method":"local-mt"}],"zh":"東京LANB","kind":"prose"},{"en":"oronto LAN","source":"image-ocr","id":"p72-b11","segments":[{"en":"oronto LAN","zh":"LAN (韓語).","method":"local-mt"}],"zh":"LAN (韓語).","kind":"prose"},{"en":"8 hosts","source":"image-ocr","id":"p72-b12","segments":[{"en":"8 hosts","zh":"8 主機","method":"local-mt"}],"zh":"8 主機","kind":"prose"},{"en":"45 hosts","source":"image-ocr","id":"p72-b13","segments":[{"en":"45 hosts","zh":"45 主機","method":"local-mt"}],"zh":"45 主機","kind":"prose"},{"en":"192.168.1.0/24","source":"image-ocr","id":"p72-b14","segments":[{"en":"192.168.1.0/24","zh":"192.168.1.0/24","method":"verbatim"}],"zh":"192.168.1.0/24","kind":"code"},{"en":"VLSM - steps","source":"image-ocr","id":"p72-b15","segments":[{"en":"VLSM - steps","zh":"VLSM -- -- 步驟","method":"local-mt"}],"zh":"VLSM -- -- 步驟","kind":"prose"},{"en":"1) Assign the largest subnet at the start of the address space.","source":"image-ocr","id":"p72-b16","segments":[{"en":"1) Assign the largest subnet at the start of the address space.","zh":"1 在地址空間開始時指定最大的子網路.","method":"local-mt"}],"zh":"1 在地址空間開始時指定最大的子網路.","kind":"prose"},{"en":"2) Assign the second-largest subnet after it.","source":"image-ocr","id":"p72-b17","segments":[{"en":"2) Assign the second-largest subnet after it.","zh":"2 分出後第二大子網路.","method":"local-mt"}],"zh":"2 分出後第二大子網路.","kind":"prose"},{"en":"3) Repeat the process until all subnets have been assigned.","source":"image-ocr","id":"p72-b18","segments":[{"en":"3) Repeat the process until all subnets have been assigned.","zh":"3 重複這個過程,直到所有子網路都得到指定.","method":"local-mt"}],"zh":"3 重複這個過程,直到所有子網路都得到指定.","kind":"prose"}]},{"page":73,"image":"/data/pdf/pages/0073.jpg","blocks":[{"en":"VLSM","source":"image-ocr","id":"p73-b1","segments":[{"en":"VLSM","zh":"VLSM","method":"local-mt-protected-fragments"}],"zh":"VLSM","kind":"prose"},{"en":"Tokyo LAN A","source":"image-ocr","id":"p73-b2","segments":[{"en":"Tokyo LAN A","zh":"東京LAN A","method":"local-mt"}],"zh":"東京LAN A","kind":"prose"},{"en":"Toronto LAN A","source":"image-ocr","id":"p73-b3","segments":[{"en":"Toronto LAN A","zh":"多倫多LAN A","method":"local-mt"}],"zh":"多倫多LAN A","kind":"prose"},{"en":"1","source":"image-ocr","id":"p73-b4","segments":[{"en":"1","zh":"1","method":"verbatim"}],"zh":"1","kind":"code"},{"en":"3","source":"image-ocr","id":"p73-b5","segments":[{"en":"3","zh":"3","method":"verbatim"}],"zh":"3","kind":"code"},{"en":"Point-to-point connection","source":"image-ocr","id":"p73-b6","segments":[{"en":"Point-to-point connection","zh":"點對點連線","method":"local-mt"}],"zh":"點對點連線","kind":"prose"},{"en":"110 hosts","source":"image-ocr","id":"p73-b7","segments":[{"en":"110 hosts","zh":"110 主機","method":"local-mt"}],"zh":"110 主機","kind":"prose"},{"en":"29 hosts","source":"image-ocr","id":"p73-b8","segments":[{"en":"29 hosts","zh":"29 主機","method":"local-mt"}],"zh":"29 主機","kind":"prose"},{"en":"Tokyo LAN B","source":"image-ocr","id":"p73-b9","segments":[{"en":"Tokyo LAN B","zh":"東京LANB","method":"local-mt"}],"zh":"東京LANB","kind":"prose"},{"en":"oronto LAN B","source":"image-ocr","id":"p73-b10","segments":[{"en":"oronto LAN B","zh":"或LAN B","method":"local-mt"}],"zh":"或LAN B","kind":"prose"},{"en":"8 hosts","source":"image-ocr","id":"p73-b11","segments":[{"en":"8 hosts","zh":"8 主機","method":"local-mt"}],"zh":"8 主機","kind":"prose"},{"en":"45 hosts","source":"image-ocr","id":"p73-b12","segments":[{"en":"45 hosts","zh":"45 主機","method":"local-mt"}],"zh":"45 主機","kind":"prose"},{"en":"4","source":"image-ocr","id":"p73-b13","segments":[{"en":"4","zh":"4","method":"verbatim"}],"zh":"4","kind":"code"},{"en":"2","source":"image-ocr","id":"p73-b14","segments":[{"en":"2","zh":"2","method":"verbatim"}],"zh":"2","kind":"code"},{"en":"1 .0/24","source":"image-ocr","id":"p73-b15","segments":[{"en":"1 .0/24","zh":"1 .0/24","method":"verbatim"}],"zh":"1 .0/24","kind":"code"},{"en":"192.168.","source":"image-ocr","id":"p73-b16","segments":[{"en":"192.168.","zh":"192.168.","method":"verbatim"}],"zh":"192.168.","kind":"code"},{"en":"So, in order: \nTOKYO LAN A (110 HOSTS) \nTORONTO LAN B (45 HOSTS) \nTORONTO LAN A (29 HOSTS) \nTOKYO LAN B (8 HOSTS) \nand \nTHE POINT TO POINT CONNECTION (between the two ROUTERS) \n192.168.1.0 / 24 \n1000 0000 . 1010 1000 . 0000 0001 | 0000 0000 (last is host octet = 254 usable hosts) \nShifting LEFT - we DOUBLE the # of hosts Shifting RIGHT - we HALF the # of hosts \nTOKYO LAN A (we need to borrow 1 host bits, to the RIGHT, to leave enough for 2^7 or 128 hosts. More \nthan enough for TOKYO A) \nso: \n192.168.1.0/25 (Network Address) \n1000 0000 . 1010 1000 . 0000 0001 . 0 | 000 0000 \n \nConverting remaining Host Bits to 1s: \n0111 1111, we get 127 so \n \n192.168.1.127/25 is the Broadcast Address \n \nTOKYO LAN A \nNETWORK ADDRESS: 192.168.1.0/25 \nBROADCAST ADDRESS: 192.168.1.127/25 \nFIRST USABLE: 192.168.1.1/25 \nLAST USABLE: 192.168.1.126/25 \nTOTAL NUMBER OF USABLE HOSTS: 126 (2^7 -2) \n \nSince TOKYO LAN A is 192.168.1.127, the next Subnet (TOKYO LAN B) starts at 192.168.1.128 \n(Network Address)","source":"text","id":"p73-b17","segments":[{"en":"So, in order:","zh":"所以,按照順序:","method":"local-mt"},{"en":"TOKYO LAN A (110 HOSTS)","zh":"東京LAN A(110主機)","method":"local-mt","version":2},{"en":"TORONTO LAN B (45 HOSTS)","zh":"託龍託LAN B (45主機)","method":"local-mt","version":2},{"en":"TORONTO LAN A (29 HOSTS)","zh":"託倫託 LAN A (29主機)","method":"local-mt","version":2},{"en":"TOKYO LAN B (8 HOSTS)","zh":"東京LAN B(8主機)","method":"local-mt","version":2},{"en":"and","zh":"財務報告和已審計財務報表","method":"local-mt"},{"en":"THE POINT TO POINT CONNECTION (between the two ROUTERS)","zh":"指向連線點(介於兩個路由器之間)","method":"local-mt","version":2},{"en":"192.168.1.0 / 24","zh":"192.168.1.0 / 24","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"1000 0000 . 1010 1000 . 0000 0001 | 0000 0000 (last is host octet = 254 usable hosts) Shifting LEFT - we DOUBLE the # of hosts Shifting RIGHT - we HALF the # of hosts TOKYO LAN A (we need to borrow 1 host bits, to the RIGHT, to leave enough for 2^7 or 128 hosts.","zh":"1000 0000 . 1010 1000 . 0000 0001 | 0000 0000(最後一點是)主機octet = (單位:千美元)254可使用主機左轉 - 我們加倍的主機右移 - 我們一半的主機東京LANA(我們需要借用)1 主機位數,右側,足夠離開2^7或者說128 主機.","method":"local-mt-protected-fragments","version":2},{"en":"More than enough for TOKYO A) so:","zh":"餘為通京A等所為:","method":"local-mt","version":2},{"en":"192.168.1.0/25 (Network Address)","zh":"192.168.1.0/25 (網路位址)","method":"local-mt"},{"en":"1000 0000 . 1010 1000 . 0000 0001 . 0 | 000 0000","zh":"1000 0000 . 1010 1000 . 0000 0001 . 0 | 000 0000","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"Converting remaining Host Bits to 1s:","zh":"將剩餘的 主機 位元轉換為 1 :","method":"local-mt"},{"en":"0111 1111, we get 127 so","zh":"01111111,我們得到127所以","method":"local-mt"},{"en":"192.168.1.127/25 is the Broadcast Address","zh":"192.168.1.127/25是廣播位址","method":"local-mt"},{"en":"TOKYO LAN A","zh":"東京LAN A","method":"local-mt","version":2},{"en":"NETWORK ADDRESS: 192.168.1.0/25","zh":"網路位址:192.168.1.0/25","method":"local-mt","version":2},{"en":"BROADCAST ADDRESS: 192.168.1.127/25","zh":"廣播位址:192.168.1.127/25","method":"local-mt","version":2},{"en":"FIRST USABLE: 192.168.1.1/25","zh":"最早使用:192.168.1.1/25","method":"local-mt","version":2},{"en":"LAST USABLE: 192.168.1.126/25","zh":"最後一個可用的 :192.168.1.126/25","method":"local-mt-protected-fragments","version":2},{"en":"TOTAL NUMBER OF USABLE HOSTS: 126 (2^7 -2)","zh":"可用總數主機:126(2^7-2)","method":"local-mt","version":2},{"en":"Since TOKYO LAN A is 192.168.1.127, the next Subnet (TOKYO LAN B) starts at 192.168.1.128 (Network Address)","zh":"由於東京LAN A是192.168.1.127,下一個子網路(tokyoLAN B)起於192.168.1.128(網路位址)","method":"local-mt","version":2}],"zh":"所以,按照順序:\n東京LAN A(110主機)\n託龍託LAN B (45主機)\n託倫託 LAN A (29主機)\n東京LAN B(8主機)\n財務報告和已審計財務報表\n指向連線點(介於兩個路由器之間)\n192.168.1.0 / 24\n1000 0000 . 1010 1000 . 0000 0001 | 0000 0000(最後一點是)主機octet = (單位:千美元)254可使用主機左轉 - 我們加倍的主機右移 - 我們一半的主機東京LANA(我們需要借用)1 主機位數,右側,足夠離開2^7或者說128 主機.\n餘為通京A等所為:\n192.168.1.0/25 (網路位址)\n1000 0000 . 1010 1000 . 0000 0001 . 0 | 000 0000\n將剩餘的 主機 位元轉換為 1 :\n01111111,我們得到127所以\n192.168.1.127/25是廣播位址\n東京LAN A\n網路位址:192.168.1.0/25\n廣播位址:192.168.1.127/25\n最早使用:192.168.1.1/25\n最後一個可用的 :192.168.1.126/25\n可用總數主機:126(2^7-2)\n由於東京LAN A是192.168.1.127,下一個子網路(tokyoLAN B)起於192.168.1.128(網路位址)","kind":"prose"},{"en":"TORONTO LAN B \nNETWORK ADDRESS: 192.168.1.128 / 26 \nBROADCAST ADDRESS: 192.168.1.191 / 26 \nFIRST USABLE: 192.168.1.129 /26 \nLAST USABLE: 192.168.1.190 / 26 \nTOTAL NUMBER OF USABLE HOSTS: 62 (2^6 -2) \nWe need to borrow to get enough for 45 hosts.","source":"text","id":"p73-b18","segments":[{"en":"TORONTO LAN B","zh":"託倫多LAN B","method":"local-mt","version":2},{"en":"NETWORK ADDRESS: 192.168.1.128 / 26","zh":"網路位址:192.168.1.128/26","method":"local-mt","version":2},{"en":"BROADCAST ADDRESS: 192.168.1.191 / 26","zh":"廣播位址:192.168.1.191/26","method":"local-mt","version":2},{"en":"FIRST USABLE: 192.168.1.129 /26","zh":"最早使用的:192.168.1.129/26","method":"local-mt","version":2},{"en":"LAST USABLE: 192.168.1.190 / 26","zh":"最後可用:192.168.1.190/26","method":"local-mt","version":2},{"en":"TOTAL NUMBER OF USABLE HOSTS: 62 (2^6 -2)","zh":"可用總數主機:62(2^6-2)","method":"local-mt","version":2},{"en":"We need to borrow to get enough for 45 hosts.","zh":"我們需要借錢,以獲得足夠的45主機.","method":"local-mt"}],"zh":"託倫多LAN B\n網路位址:192.168.1.128/26\n廣播位址:192.168.1.191/26\n最早使用的:192.168.1.129/26\n最後可用:192.168.1.190/26\n可用總數主機:62(2^6-2)\n我們需要借錢,以獲得足夠的45主機.","kind":"prose"}]},{"page":74,"image":"/data/pdf/pages/0074.jpg","blocks":[{"en":"128 \n64 \n32 \n16 \n8 \n4 \n2 \n1","source":"text","id":"p74-b1","segments":[{"en":"128","zh":"128","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"64","zh":"64","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"32","zh":"32","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"16","zh":"16","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"8","zh":"8","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"4","zh":"4","method":"verba